.TH extrautils 1 "2026-10-17" "Extrautils 0.0.3" "extrautils Manual"
.SH extrautils
extrautils \- GNU tools rewritten
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B extrautils
[\fIcommand\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B extrautils
is GNU tools rewritten, since this tool is still in beta, some commands may be broken.

Right now, extrautils shouldn't be installed on your main system, some commands are broken.

There isn't that much commands right now, but later on, more commands like rm, ls, mv, will be added later.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.BR arch
Display machine architecture.
.TP
.BR clear
Clear terminal screen.
.TP
.BR date
Print current date.
.TP
.BR echo
Print out text from stdin.
.TP
.BR env
Print out all env variables.
.TP
.BR home
Print the $HOME variable.
.TP
.BR pwd
Print the $PWD variable.
.TP
.BR sleep
Wait for a speific amount of time
.TP
.BR touch
Change file timestamps. (this is broken)
.TP
.BR uname
Print machine info
.TP
.BR whoami
Print username
.SH AUTHOR
nothingboii42
